BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:86959d0e-9ca9-4720-b38c-35b8d02ccd0b
DTSTAMP:20260223T190459Z
DTSTART:2026-02-26T18:00:00+00:00
DTEND:2026-02-26T19:30:00+00:00
SUMMARY:Free Food @ Creative Practice Lab: Lunch Day with Artist Dario Robleto
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us at University Galleries for the inaugural semester of the Creative Practice Lab (CPL)! Socialize with other students and arts professionals; participate in professional development activities; and help shape future semesters of the group. Free food at all meetings and free to participate. Register for each event at: <a href="https://linktr.ee/universitygalleriesisu?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBEyaXNUTzRQTGUzczZwU3QxMnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6gws6kS0wZDJY3GdDeFrxezjur5Wdvw9bByCZL3AHSg09G0nR4Ena6ZIv_uQ_aem_vZI8rd089yfEuPpH79LzeA" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://linktr.ee/universitygalleriesisu</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>At this event, lunch with internationally recognized artist Dario Robleto. Join other students and University Galleries&rsquo; team for a casual lunch and conversation with the artist. Robleto will be in town for a film screening on February 24 and lecture on February 25.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>**<strong>Registration is limited to 20 currently enrolled ISU students.</strong> The registration form will be closed once capacity has been reached.&nbsp;If you have any questions, please contact&nbsp;<a class="linkified" href="mailto:Gallery@IllinoisState.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gallery@IllinoisState.edu</a>.</p>
LOCATION:University Galleries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2c7e5088-6c91-4f3f-bf3e-d63443c9aa64
DTSTAMP:20260223T190459Z
DTSTART:2026-02-26T23:30:00+00:00
DTEND:2026-02-27T02:30:00+00:00
SUMMARY:Free Food/Stuff @ Dinner &  A Movie : Wicked: For Good
DESCRIPTION:<p>Enjoy dinner, a backstage tour of Braden Auditorium, and Wicked: For Good!</p>
<p>Limit 150 participants. Admission is first come, first serve. No RSVP required. RSVP does not guarantee participation.</p>
<p><strong>Doors Open &amp; Optional Tour of Braden Auditorium Backstage: </strong>5:30&nbsp;p.m.</p>
<p><strong>Dinner Served &amp; Movie Begins:</strong>&nbsp;6&nbsp;P.M.</p>
<p>Menu: Baked Potato Bar</p>
<p><em>If you need accommodation to fully participate in this program/event, please contact Event Management, Dining, and Hospitality at 309-438-8351 or <a href="mailto:EMDH@IllinoisState.edu">EMDH@IllinoisState.edu</a>. Please allow sufficient time to arrange the accommodation.</em></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
LOCATION:Braden Auditorium, Bone Student Center
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:cb8c8427-574c-49d4-b7f5-7350bc0c3ea8
DTSTAMP:20260223T190459Z
DTSTART:2026-02-27T18:00:00+00:00
DTEND:2026-02-27T19:00:00+00:00
SUMMARY:Free Food @ Conversations Café
DESCRIPTION:<p data-start="141" data-end="222"><strong data-start="141" data-end="163">Conversations Caf&eacute;</strong><br data-start="163" data-end="166" />🕛 12:00 &ndash; 1:00 PM<br data-start="184" data-end="187" />📍 OIE Lobby, 2nd Floor Fell Hall</p>
<p data-start="224" data-end="465">Join us for the Conversations Caf&eacute;, a cozy, coffee shop&ndash;style gathering hosted by the OIE I-House and Academic Teams. This program offers a welcoming space for students to connect, unwind, and engage in global conversations.</p>
<p data-start="467" data-end="658"><strong>Enjoy:</strong><br data-start="473" data-end="476" />✅ Coffee, tea, and snacks from a featured country<br data-start="525" data-end="528" />✅ Board games and friendly, global conversations<br data-start="576" data-end="579" />✅ A craft table and stress-relief activities<br data-start="623" data-end="626" />✅ A calm, inclusive atmosphere</p>
<p data-start="660" data-end="834">Whether you want to practice your English, learn about different cultures, meet new people, or take a break from a busy week, this is the perfect place to relax and recharge.</p>
<p data-start="836" data-end="883"><strong data-start="836" data-end="883">All students are welcome&mdash;no RSVP necessary!</strong></p>
LOCATION:Fell Hall, Second Floor Lobby
END:VEVENT
