DTSTART:2026-03-05T17:00:00+00:00
DTEND:2026-03-05T20:00:00+00:00
SUMMARY:Free Food @ Multicultural Center: Pancakes and Pajamas
DESCRIPTION:<p><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW179079924 BCX0">We're inviting students to wear their coziest pajamas and stop by the MCC for a light breakfast bar featuring&nbsp;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW179079924 BCX0">pancakes, waffles, fruit, coffee</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW179079924 BCX0">&nbsp;and more</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW179079924 BCX0">. The goal is to promote comfort, self-care, and&nbsp;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW179079924 BCX0">de-stressing during midterms.&nbsp;</span></p>
LOCATION:Multicultural Center
END:VEVENT
